SUMMARY:LAS - Info session with Walsh Group: Summer 2027 Internships for 
 Las Majors
TZID:America/Chicago
CREATED:20260718T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260718T010000Z
DESCRIPTION:Curious about careers that combine leadership\, problem-solvi
 ng\, and making a tangible impact? Join The Walsh Group to learn about o
 ur Summer 2027 Internship Program designed for students pursuing Liberal
  Arts & Sciences (LAS) majors. This session will introduce you to the co
 nstruction industry and show how students from non-traditional backgroun
 ds can build successful careers in project management and operations. Yo
 u'll hear about our new program which provides hands-on experience\, str
 uctured training\, mentorship\, and professional development to help you
  succeed - no prior construction experience required. During the session
 \, you'll:Learn about Summer 2027 internship opportunitiesDiscover how y
 our LAS skills translate to construction and project managementHear abou
 t training\, mentorship\, and career growth through the programMeet Wals
 h recruiters and ask questions about the application processIf you're in
 terested in working with people\, solving complex challenges\, and build
 ing projects that shape communities\, we'd love to meet you!
