SUMMARY:LAS - AlphaSights Coffee Chat
TZID:America/Chicago
CREATED:20260806T010000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260806T010000Z
DESCRIPTION:If you are interested in learning more about our Client Servi
 ce internships (for juniors) and full-time opportunities (for seniors)\,
  sign up here for a one 1:1 coffee chat with AlphaSights representatives
  Leah Clarke\, Talent Acquisition\, and Calloway Nettles\, Consulting. T
 his experience offers you the opportunity to connect individually\, ask 
 questions and gain personalized insight into internships & careers at Al
 phaSights. Learn from the experts what it is like to work with consultin
 g firms and client services! Chats will be by appointment only. All majo
 rs are welcome. Compensation for Client Services: 2027 Full-Time: Expect
  total first-year compensation ranging from $90-110k (average to high pe
 rformance)\, consisting of (i) an annual base salary of $80\,000 and (ii
 ) uncapped variable compensation linked to individual performance. Summe
 r 2027 Internship: Internship compensation is $15\,384.62 for a 10-week 
 program. Qualifications for our Client Services Team Strong academic cre
 dentials (undergraduate GPA of 3.3 or above) Work authorization in the U
 nited States\; we do not sponsor visas but will consider applicants with
  3-year STEM OPT eligibility About AlphaSights: Since 2008\, we’ve been 
 connecting investors and business leaders with the knowledge they need t
 o succeed. Working from nine cities globally\, our 1500+ colleagues prov
 ide round-the-clock coverage to the world’s top investment funds\, consu
 ltancies\, and businesses. Learn more about us at alphasights.com/career
 s. As a Client Service Associate\, you are the critical link between our
  top-tier clients and the expert knowledge they seek. Our team represent
 s 60+ nationalities\, offering our clients global perspectives and 24/7 
 support.
LOCATION:Lincoln Hall
CATEGORIES:Professional Development
CONTACT:Kristy Krisher 217-300-3330
ORGANIZER:krush6@illinois.edu
URL:https://calendars.illinois.edu/detail/6499/33557470?key=2000010120000
 10133557470
